# remove-bg-photo — environment (names only, no values committed)
#
# Browser-only inference needs NO secret: the model runs locally in a Web
# Worker and no image pixels leave the device. Every variable below is
# optional and only affects where static assets are served from.

# Origin that serves the heavy artifacts (model + WASM runtime), with a
# trailing slash. Leave blank to serve them from this same origin
# (public/models, public/wasm). Set it when the model lives on a CDN/HF Space,
# e.g. https://huggingface.co/spaces/<owner>/<repo>/resolve/main/
VITE_ASSET_BASE=
